// Workspace-only fix: gorm.io/driver/clickhouse pulls the pre-split
// github.com/ugorji/go v1.1.4 (which still contains the codec package) into
// the merged workspace build list, conflicting with github.com/ugorji/go/codec.
// v1.2.x no longer provides the codec package from the parent module.
replace github.com/ugorji/go => github.com/ugorji/go v1.2.12
